  "6405505f-4b92-3bd6-0c3b-4a196e24893c"],
 " identifies isomorphic states, states that are the same up to a renaming of \
their vertices. Every path of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], "+", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6878c7f8-419e-9db5-1807-dea27028e79f"],
 " edges is then one state, so the chain rule has one state per step:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1149283354,ExpressionUUID->"48a3d607-c312-9dd3-7850-c860f6a4e739"],

